<h2>How it works</h2>
<p>Blokada 6 uses Blokada Cloud. The app points your device at a private, encrypted DNS service that leaves out ads and trackers, so they are never loaded. Nothing runs in the background and your battery is not affected.</p>
<p>One account covers all your devices. For devices that cannot run the app, such as routers, TVs and computers, the <a href="/guides/">setup guides</a> show how to use the same service.</p>
<p>What was blocked, and what you want to allow, is in the app and in the <a href="{{ site.dashboard }}/?src=landing">web dashboard</a>.</p>

